meta {
  name: List all Receipts
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/general/receipts?page=&limit=&orderBy=&search=&sortBy=
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  page: 
  limit: 
  orderBy: 
  search: 
  sortBy: 
}

vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: http://localhost:3000
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # List all Receipts
  
  Returns a paginated list of receipt records. Results can be sorted and filtered by search terms.
  
  ## Authorization
  
  - **Authentication:** Required — Bearer token via `authenticate()`.
  - **Permission:** `read` — enforced by `authorize("read")`.
  
  ## Request
  
  ### Query Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type   | Required | Default     | Description / Allowed Values                                                                                              |
  |-----------|--------|----------|-------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | `page`    | number | No       | `1`         | Page number (integer ≥ 1)                                                                                                 |
  | `limit`   | number | No       | `25`        | Items per page (integer, 1–100)                                                                                           |
  | `orderBy` | string | No       | `desc`      | Sort direction. One of: `asc`, `desc`                                                                                     |
  | `sortBy`  | string | No       | `createdAt` | Field to sort by. One of: `name`, `amount`, `description`, `uploadedBy`, `createdAt`                                      |
  | `search`  | string | No       | —           | Full-text search query. When provided, cache is bypassed and results are matched against the text search vector.          |
  
  ### Searchable Fields
  
  Full-text search queries match against the following columns using PostgreSQL text search:
  
  | Field         | Weight |
  |---------------|--------|
  | `name`        | A      |
  | `uploadedBy`  | A      |
  | `amount`      | B      |
  | `description` | C      |
  
  Plain text amount search is also performed using a fallback ILIKE comparison.
  
  ## Response
  
  **`200 OK`** — Returns a paginated list of receipts.
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Found all receipts successfully",
    "data": [
      {
        "id": "69d6a93c-25f2-4d52-8155-53025f0cb775",
        "name": "Printing Receipts",
        "amount": 12500,
        "description": "Printing flyers and registration materials",
        "uploadedBy": "admin",
        "imageUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/...",
        "imagePublicId": "cloudinary_public_id",
        "createdAt": "2026-06-17T17:49:47.256Z",
        "updatedAt": null,
        "deletedAt": null
      }
    ],
    "meta": {
      "pagination": {
        "page": 1,
        "limit": 25,
        "totalPages": 1
      }
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ## Caching
  
  - **Cache Key:** `cedarrise:dashboard:receipts:{page}:{limit}:{orderBy}:{sortBy}`
  - **TTL:** 1 hour (3600 seconds — `DASHBOARD_CARDS`)
  - **Bypass:** Caching is bypassed entirely when a `search` query parameter is provided.
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status                      | Description                                                  |
  |-----------------------------|--------------------------------------------------------------|
  | `400 Bad Request`           | Invalid query parameters (e.g. invalid `sortBy` or `limit`). |
  | `401 Unauthorized`          | Missing or invalid Bearer token.                             |
  | `403 Forbidden`             | Insufficient permissions.                                    |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error.                                     |
}
